WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.240
Is 3 + 2 the same as 2 + 3?

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:05.540
Yes!

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:08.810
Turn the row around and the cars don't change.

00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:14.640
2 + 3, or 3 + 2: both make 5.

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:17.710
With adding, order never matters.

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:21.013
Start with the bigger number to count on faster.
